WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.170
- I'd love to leave you with
a little something to go,

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:04.902
and we like to call it (clicks
fingers) the doggy bag.

00:00:04.902 --> 00:00:07.214
(audience applause)

00:00:07.214 --> 00:00:08.149
(dog barks)

00:00:08.149 --> 00:00:08.982
(man barks)

00:00:08.982 --> 00:00:09.820
There it goes.

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:12.310
And today we're talking about a product

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:13.770
that I am a huge fan of,

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:15.860
and I hope you guys are gonna love it.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.184
It, what?

00:00:17.184 --> 00:00:18.148
(audience applause)

00:00:18.148 --> 00:00:19.775
- Uh, Drew.

00:00:19.775 --> 00:00:22.396
(audience cheering)

00:00:22.396 --> 00:00:23.229
Oh.

00:00:24.835 --> 00:00:28.014
What?
(audience cheering)

00:00:28.014 --> 00:00:28.847
- Hello.

00:00:28.847 --> 00:00:30.421
- Hello, hello, hello, hello.

00:00:30.421 --> 00:00:31.587
Look who's here.

00:00:31.587 --> 00:00:33.725
- Look at this.

00:00:33.725 --> 00:00:35.687
- [Dr. Phil] What's up?

00:00:35.687 --> 00:00:37.300
- [Drew] I'm so happy to see you.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.390
- Well, I heard you were shooting
on the lot and, you know,

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.550
I've been here so long,
I'm like the welcome wagon,

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:46.530
so I brought you a welcome
basket, and you know,

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:49.618
your grandfather shot a
lot of movies here, right?

00:00:49.618 --> 00:00:50.451
- I know.

00:00:50.451 --> 00:00:54.390
- So I found some photos
of him on the lot here.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:55.975
So how about that?

00:00:55.975 --> 00:00:56.857
- That is so sweet.
(audience cheers)

00:00:56.857 --> 00:00:58.050
- [Dr. Phil] Hollywood royalty, right?

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:59.821
- I mean, hello? That is so sweet.

00:00:59.821 --> 00:01:01.168
- Yeah?

00:01:01.168 --> 00:01:02.001
- And.

00:01:02.001 --> 00:01:04.150
- You know, I knew that he was here,

00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:07.570
but I didn't have any
photographic evidence of it.

00:01:07.570 --> 00:01:08.500
- Yeah, well there you go.

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.850
And I've got something
even more special for you.

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:12.033
This is amazing.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:17.190
You know, he shot one of
the most iconic movies ever.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.800
(crowd cheers)

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:24.450
This is the original poster

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:27.831
for "Dr. Jekyll and Mr.
Hyde" from the twenties.

00:01:27.831 --> 00:01:29.129
- [Ross] Aww.

00:01:29.129 --> 00:01:30.180
(crowd cheers)

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:35.180
- I am, I'm going to put
these up immediately.

00:01:35.540 --> 00:01:39.710
I love that you're going to be
associated with these moments

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:42.480
because you're bringing
me closer to my roots.

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:44.680
- You're welcome, and thank
you for being my friend,

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:47.730
and welcome to the Paramount
lot, do not park in my spot.

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:48.903
- I won't.

00:01:48.903 --> 00:01:49.736
(crowd applauds)

00:01:49.736 --> 00:01:53.198
- I will let you finish your
show and do what you do.

00:01:53.198 --> 00:01:54.252
- I love you, Phil.

00:01:54.252 --> 00:01:56.092
- All right, guys.
- Give my love to Robin.

00:01:56.092 --> 00:01:57.386
- We'll see you, so long.

00:01:57.386 --> 00:02:00.340
(crowd cheers)

00:02:00.340 --> 00:02:03.607
- Well, thank you, Ross.
Thank you, Dr. Phil.

00:02:03.607 --> 00:02:05.130
"House Calls with Dr. Phil"

00:02:05.130 --> 00:02:07.830
actually airs Wednesdays
at 9:00 p.m. on CBS,

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:12.060
and season 20 of "Dr. Phil" airs weekdays,

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:14.240
and you check your
local listings for that.

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.440
I want to thank all of our guests,

00:02:16.440 --> 00:02:19.943
and I feel so lucky and I just...

00:02:19.943 --> 00:02:21.106
- [Crowd Member] Love you, Drew.

00:02:21.106 --> 00:02:22.409
- I love you guys.

00:02:22.409 --> 00:02:23.393
(crowd cheers)

00:02:23.393 --> 00:02:27.021
Thank you for everyone
watching at home or on the go.

00:02:27.021 --> 00:02:30.297
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:02:30.297 --> 00:02:32.964
(upbeat music)

